{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8001_p", "source_sha256": "29b744af43726e84243732fc12a3b3d57c53eab917274262ffacfd39ac4e7c9c", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\n琴葉はサイバー犯罪対策イベントに出ることになった）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，琴叶将参加网络犯罪防范活动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8002_017kth", "source_sha256": "c032fa61b5bbf099e92c5013a45ede3abacae995296559295eeb6682b976c92d", "ja": "フィッシング詐欺やモバイル機器のウイルス感染……。\n他にも、サイバー犯罪の種類は、たくさんありますね。", "zh": "网络钓鱼诈骗、移动设备感染病毒……还有很多其他类型的网络犯罪呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8003_p", "source_sha256": "b9501d4254ddc9bdd6dff68f8275306a7f981a28311e10adeeafa11126311b3b", "ja": "ああ。今や身近な犯罪のひとつだ。\nやけに詳しいけど、勉強してきたのか？", "zh": "啊。如今已经是身边常见的犯罪之一了。\n你知道得还真详细，是特意学习过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8004_017kth", "source_sha256": "7514d31195b3b4fc7385c8ecb47e16afdfbf987ba38224bf06683904216c36c5", "ja": "トークショーがあるって聞きましたから。でも……\n真面目なことばかり話すのも、よくないでしょうか？", "zh": "因为听说有脱口秀。不过……\n\n如果一直只聊严肃的话题，是不是也不太好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8005_p", "source_sha256": "6005775fcfec6e08350095a26b52047b77b928bddafcda1a9785afac51c34c5e", "ja": "そんなことはないよ。それに、真面目な話でも\n楽しんでもらう方法はたくさんあるはずだ。", "zh": "没那回事。而且，就算是严肃的话题，\n也一定有很多能让大家听得开心的方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8006_017kth", "source_sha256": "c9c9f909f735babb4cf35f0b62020008137bdc424f37db328e4961bd205a1742", "ja": "楽しみながら知ってもらう……\nどんな方法があるんでしょうか？", "zh": "一边享受乐趣，一边让大家了解……究竟有哪些方法呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8007", "source_sha256": "1e5fff1e244b41d776b32328199f190f8de77ee5c44132c1d6681e5ce941af5c", "ja": "即興劇", "zh": "即兴剧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8008", "source_sha256": "d2413147f7958f711b0716d2ffaad2c07582374300cca932e77ed27529c55696", "ja": "○×クイズ", "zh": "○×问答", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8009", "source_sha256": "513adafb4964376501fd4ae1c1a5b9635585585988508a200fd2d84a511c0404", "ja": "ダジャレ", "zh": "冷笑话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8100_p", "source_sha256": "582d02d2d58f1c5109a8c82e07d2da23dda9ae9d61ac36f5cd7076ef1fe90c9e", "ja": "即興で犯罪の手口を演じてみせるのはどうだ？\n琴葉の腕の見せ所だと思う。", "zh": "要不要即兴演示一下犯罪手法？\n我觉得这正是琴叶大显身手的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8101_017kth", "source_sha256": "4b10a4fa1a057e5b58eb0ea5e1c69bbdbf83181adea2c64b2c63f4b5f95fc15e", "ja": "緩急をつけて、飽きさせない工夫をする……。\nみんなにも楽しんでもらえるなら……。", "zh": "通过调节节奏的张弛，想办法不让大家感到无聊……如果能让大家也享受其中的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8102_017kth", "source_sha256": "9aac6b165f01ea4ba2b7c6e634fd104bf8f4fa2d83689052e0576692914b512d", "ja": "私、頑張ってみます！　本番までに、\nサイバー犯罪をテーマにしたお芝居を考えなきゃ……！", "zh": "我会努力的！在正式演出之前，\n得想出一个以网络犯罪为主题的剧本才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8200_p", "source_sha256": "95155c12f5193d2dd2a62fb12e99370521a3638bf714792a642419e061998440", "ja": "サイバー犯罪に関する〇×クイズなんてどうだ？\n2択だから簡単だし、盛り上がるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "做个关于网络犯罪的正误问答怎么样？\n只有2个选项，简单，也能活跃气氛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8201_017kth", "source_sha256": "498ac35388451575cb7e03f4b33e1059470f021af0b975c7498a7b215e07a617", "ja": "なるほど。○×クイズなら、関心のない人も\n興味を持って聞いてくれるかもしれません。", "zh": "原来如此。如果是判断题，说不定连不感兴趣的人也会产生兴趣，愿意听下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8202_017kth", "source_sha256": "df2c063acc1ad7aa7d45c5af5ccc0e113e98d30cc7d0c0fe5c1cd04b5da6bc43", "ja": "さっそく、問題を作ってみます。　\n{$P$}も考えてみてください。", "zh": "我马上试着出几道题。\n也请{$P$}想一想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8300_p", "source_sha256": "8ddc7af368fa741019af4ee36e33a3f6d177052ce9e82cc51ecbb8e6eaff62d5", "ja": "ダジャレで犯罪対策をアピールするのはどうだ？\n笑いも交えて伝えた方が、盛り上がるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "用冷笑话来宣传犯罪预防怎么样？\n加点笑料来传达的话，气氛不是会更热烈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8301_017kth", "source_sha256": "fddea52de8a07bb2e45a5bd9e46515df12c8c940c76f13816655ccdfc7eb8aaf", "ja": "たしかに、楽しんではもらえそうですけど、\n犯罪を軽視しているように見えないでしょうか……。", "zh": "确实可能会让大家觉得有趣，但这样会不会显得我们在轻视犯罪呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_8302_017kth", "source_sha256": "1e57072a53858c3b6b1a2f6d3d55fdffef1ce39c85b2c4e274414bbe1d96b5c8", "ja": "ダジャレを考えるのも難しそうですし……。\nうーん……他の方法がないか考えてみます。", "zh": "要想出个双关语，似乎也很难……  \n嗯……我再想想有没有别的办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
